            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "queenreg7"
            },
            "reviewBody": "It was easy to make and delicious. I made mine sugar free by crunching up some keto snickerdoodle cookies and using monk fruit sweetener instead of sugar. Set off my fat bomb no-bake cheesecake perfectly.",
            "datePublished": "2021-07-23T00:20:22.820Z"
