              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "BraveLime5091"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I used polverone cookies( I'm in Mexico), 1/4 cup each of dry roasted peanuts and pistachios, omitted the sugar and blended with 4 tbs melted butter. Perfect for my cacao/choc chip, tofu filling. Muy delicioso!",
            "datePublished": "2025-09-01T16:05:24.414Z"
          },
